1627494779481346050/1688535438011596.png\"},{\"picUrl\":\"https://cnbj1-new.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/post/1627494779481346050/1688535438529378.png\"},{\"picUrl\":\"https://cnbj1-new.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/post/1627494779481346050/1688535438802674.png\"}],\"picNum\":6},{\"id\":\"1651490196794294274\",\"label\":1,\"title\":\"光固化模型如何进行清理？\",\"thumbnail\":\"大部分模型由于在打印过程中添加了支撑结构，所以需要进行一系列的打印后处理的工作。\\n大体上分为以下几个步骤：\\n（1）酒精浸润。\\n将取下的模型浸润到工业酒精中，等待液态树脂固化。\\n（2）去除支撑。\\n可用镊子剪刀等工具去除支撑材料，需要小心谨慎，以免刮伤模型表面或刺伤皮肤。\",\"type\":\"369852\",\"state\":1,\"currentUserIsLiked\":false,\"curLikeNum\":0,\"likeNum\":\"41\",\"createdTime\":1682580921000,\"authorInfo\":{\"id\":\"1627493325068685313\",\"userNickname\":\"无事小神仙\",\"userLevel\":1,\"identityType\":2,\"reminded\":false,\"medalVos\":[{\"medalId\":\"1539509191976108033\",\"name\":\"顶尖创客\",\"describe\":\"累计经验值达到{0}，并登录{1}天\",\"experience\":6330,\"loginDay\":300,\"shareRatio\":80,\"icon\":\"https://cnbj1.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/medal/10.png\",\"obtain\":null,\"level\":10},{\"medalId\":\"1539509191997079554\",\"name\":\"名匠创客\",\"describe\":\"累计经验值达到{0}，并登录{1}天\",\"experience\":4760,\"loginDay\":230,\"shareRatio\":80,\"icon\":\"https://cnbj1.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/medal/9.png\",\"obtain\":null,\"level\":9},{\"medalId\":\"1539509191997079555\",\"name\":\"大师创客\",\"describe\":\"累计经验值达到{0}，并登录{1}天\",\"experience\":3470,\"loginDay\":180,\"shareRatio\":70,\"icon\":\"https://cnbj1.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/medal/8.png\",\"obtain\":null,\"level\":8},{\"medalId\":\"1539509191997079556\",\"name\":\"达人创客\",\"describe\":\"累计经验值达到{0}，并登录{1}天\",\"experience\":2520,\"loginDay\":150,\"shareRatio\":70,\"icon\":\"https://cnbj1.fds.api.xiaomi.com/shengma-3d-printing-public/medal/7.png\",\"obtain\":null,\"level\":7},{\"medalId\":\"1539509191997079557\",\"name\":\"专业创客\",\"describe\":\"累计经验值达到{0}，并登录{1}天\",\"experience\":1735,\"loginDay\":125,\"shareRatio\"